    {
      "id": "claim_17de77ecd24741d3b63375cb0665992e",
      "statement": "The taxable-account fixed-income guide governs portfolio-manager holdings within its stated limits, and mandate-specific tighter bands prevail over the discretion matrix, which cannot grant broader discretion.",
