      "statement": "The guide specifies an 18% municipal neutral weight without the private-activity concentration for clients below the top federal bracket; the still-current 2025-06 note historically grounds the concentration in an after-tax top-bracket advantage, but the 2026 AMT threshold change constrains that premise.",
